  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 103.45 Liquid waste",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 103.45 “Liquid waste” means any waste that is determined to contain “free liquids” as defined by Method 9095B (Paint Filter Liquids Test), included in “Test Methods for Evaluating Solid Waste, Physical/Chemical Methods” (EPA Publication SW–846), Third Edition, November 1986, as amended through Update VII, dated July 30, 2021, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #14103, eff 10-23-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
